error: `int | None` may be `None` here
 --> main.ty:3:11
  |
3 |     print(n + 1)
  |           ^ this is `int | None`, not `int`
  |
  = note: narrowing happens only inside an `if`; it does not flow through `and`, `or` or a loop condition, see DESIGN.md section 3.8
  = help: narrow it first: assign it to a local, then test it in an `if` with `x is None` / `x is not None`
